      <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">Attached hereto and incorporated by reference herein is a press release issued by the Registrant entitled: &#8220;RedHill Biopharma
        Announces Plan to Implement ADS Ratio Change&#8221;.</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25;"><br style="line-height: 1.25;">
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">This Form 6-K is hereby incorporated by reference into the Company's Registration Statements on Form S-8 filed with the Securities and
